{"id":"uspet_","lemma":"успеть","pos":"verb","rank":1987,"glosses":["to have time, to find time","to manage (to do something), to succeed","to make it, to arrive in time (for), to be in time (for)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d5/Ru-%D1%83%D1%81%D0%BF%D0%B5%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D1%83%D1%81%D0%BF%D0%B5%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"future":{"1s":"успею","2s":"успеешь","3s":"успеет","1p":"успеем","2p":"успеете","3p":"успеют"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"успей","2p":"успейте"}}},"past":{"m":"успел","p":"успели","f":"успела","n":"успело"},"aspect":"perfective","aspectPartner":"успевать","examples":[{"text":"Когда ты успел всё это сделать?","en":"When did you have time to do all this?","words":[{"g":"when"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"everything, all"},{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"to make, to do"}]},{"text":"Думаешь, мы успеем?","en":"Do you think we'll be on time?","words":[{"g":"to think","l":"думать"},{"g":"we"},null]},{"text":"Мы всё ещё можем успеть.","en":"We can still get there on time.","words":[{"g":"we"},null,null,{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},null],"phrases":[[1,3,"still, yet, as yet"]]},{"text":"Мы успели вовремя.","en":"We're on time.","words":[{"g":"we"},null,{"g":"in time"}]},{"text":"Ты успеешь поесть?","en":"Do you have time to eat?","words":[{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"to eat"}]}]}